    LOG["Receiver log or stream<br/>NMEA, u-blox UBX, RINEX, SBF<br/>RTCM, NovAtel, RTKLIB, IQ"] --> ING["Ingest<br/>per-epoch observables<br/>and the receiver's own flags"]
